# EDGAR monitor — run logs + date-stamped weekly digests are disposable/untracked.
# Only signals/EDGAR_MONITOR_CALIBRATION.md is committed; the edgar_YYYY-MM-DD.md
# digests regenerate each scan. The `edgar_2*` glob is scoped so it never matches
# EDGAR_MONITOR_CALIBRATION.md.
signals/cache/
signals/edgar_2*.md

# Funnel log (Tier 6.2) — runtime market-cap cache + transient temp DBs
# (data/funnel_log.db IS committed; only the cache + temp scratch are ignored)
data/market_cap_cache.json
data/relative_return_cache.json
data/_tmp*.db

